        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "“I had an amazing experience at Meena.k Beauty Salon. I got a facial done and I must say the service was excellent. I also tried their Korean facial, and it was really good — my skin felt fresh, glowing, and so relaxed after the treatment. She is very professional, gentle, and knows exactly what she’s doing. The products and techniques were high quality, and the overall experience was very satisfying. Highly recommended for anyone looking for great facial and skincare services. I will definitely come back again!”",
        "time": 1769817942,
        "translated": false
