        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL0A7QbOUNA4om9b8_RHyY5LCRq_Z72bD1qQmW936x5n7Y41w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We started going to Meena through a friend's recommendation. The service and results are exactly what we expected; she's kind, caring, gentle, knowledgeable, professional, punctual, passionate, flexible with schedule. Her advices are very accurate, prices are reasonable and you will feel comfortable with her. I've had a lot of great results with her!",
        "time": 1766766172,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
