        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Meena is amazing! Her skin and laser services are professional, effective, and done with great care. She’s kind, gentle, and makes you feel completely comfortable. Highly recommend her for anyone looking for quality skincare and laser treatments.",
